{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1000_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0b73f81a4cd4959824eb656b6251dbd900fc1855934fdc20f89996b50b35baee", "ja": "あっ！　{$P$}さんだ～。\nおはようございま～す♪", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生～\n早安～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1001_p", "source_sha256": "67a06cad5949ca2dbd28dd042b1aef75c1c87ab1ad40802af636c28bf03efdec", "ja": "どうしたんだ翼、こんなに早く……。\nレッスンが始まるまで、まだ一時間もあるじゃないか。", "zh": "怎么啦，翼？这么早就来了……\n训练课程不是还有一个小时才开始吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f8691683d82e42a77d7399bdd43019532729929d32b558cbfb332d39fcb1fb91", "ja": "学校が早く終わったから、来ちゃいました♪\n{$P$}さん、遊びに行きましょ～？", "zh": "因为学校提早放学，我就来了♪\n{$P$}先生，我们去玩吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d9b275a7ad6f49c2107d30387f7e34ce9c7600edd99bda3ed988f27236d07daa", "ja": "なんだ、そうか。翼にもようやく、アイドルとしての\n自覚が芽生えてきたのかと思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "怎么，原来是这样啊。\n我还以为翼终于也萌生身为偶像的自觉了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf6e03f392a1d36235526f4091b77028e77e3a2c0a5fca6c1fe9c7d6c2724691", "ja": "{$P$}さん、ひどーい！　最近、\nレッスンちょっと楽しくなってきたところなのに～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生好过份～！\n我最近才开始觉得训练课程变得比较有趣了说～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1005_p", "source_sha256": "27b11dfe69852d7fa9eb12d9f5139c565d8cfe5aa257696ca8da946eaac482d4", "ja": "なら、もっと頑張ろうな！　最近は、\n頑張る女の子がモテるって、雑誌に書いてあったよ。", "zh": "那就再多努力一点吧！\n杂志上也写说近来努力的女孩子很受欢迎喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0011_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0011_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "0e2c8574527c43f2cfe82308cddea9153cd1598da5766b36ed06998e989ee042", "ja": "え～、ホントですか～？\nならわたし、ちょっとだけ頑張っちゃおうかな～。", "zh": "咦～真的吗～？\n那，我就再多加油一下好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
